\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's real ends weaker on Cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2000\par 22:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par SAO PAULO, March 24 (Reuters) - The Brazilian real\tab   ended trading Friday markedly weaker against the dollar after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market, buying dollars, traders said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par After opening trading notably stronger at around 1.714 per dollar, the real closed the session at 1.734, 0.7 percent weaker than its closing rate on Thursday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  The real had been trading most of the week at its strongest against the dollar since May, boosted by capital inflows linked to foreign direct investment. It ended 0.3 percent stronger on the week \par \par \uc2  "The purchase of dollars made this morning by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was sufficient to hold the price of the dollar higher the rest of the day," a trader at a local bank said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed after the market's close that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, thought it did not specify whether it bought or sold dollars. \par \par \uc2  Excluding the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market, analysts said there should be a strong net inflow of dollars by the end of the day. They added that traders are expecting a net inflow of $400 million. \par \par \uc2  "The deals were basically from direct foreign investments, especially in the telecommunication sector," a trader at a local bank said. \par \par \uc2  ((Sao Paulo newsroom 55 11 248 5417)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw3o03sc8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
