\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil's Real Ends At BRR1.8100/Dlr Vs BRR1.8280 Tuesday \b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 1999\par 20:54\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO -(Dow Jones)- The Brazilian real (BRR) closed stronger against the dollar Wednesday, in very thin volume, as capital inflows outweighed outflows, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "Today's (Wednesday) gains are not very significant as volume is so light it doesn't take much to influence the exchange rate," said a Rio de Janeiro-based \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader. \par \par \uc2  The Brazilian real closed at a midrate of BRR1.8100 to the dollar on a spread of BRR1.8090-1.8110 per dollar, compared with an opening rate of BRR1.8260 on a similar spread. \par \par \uc2  Traders said volume is likely to be even thinner Thursday ahead of the New Year holiday period and that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be extra vigilant to prevent sharp movements in the exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  "With volume so low it is relatively easy for players to influence the exchange rate to their advantage," said the trader. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was absent from the market Wednesday, after having \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday after the real dipped to BRR1.8320 against the dollar. This was the fourth \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  so far in December. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign reserves stood at $38.174 billion Tuesday, slightly up from Monday's $38.142 billion level. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Brazil's daily international reserves figures are available at the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's web page:\par \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bcb.gov.br/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bcb.gov.br}}}\uc2 \f2 .\par -By Kieran Gartlan; Dow Jones Newswires;(5511) 813-1988;\par kgartlan@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dj00000020010827dvct07wbj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
