\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Selic rate steady, Cenbank not  \highlight22\uc2 intervening \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 196 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Dezember 1999\par 14:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, Dec 14 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's benchmark overnight interest rate Selic opened steady on Tuesday at between 18.91 and 18.93 percent in a quiet money market in which the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  The Selic has been trading at between 18.91 and 18.95 for over a week. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has again refrained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market because of balanced flows, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  last borrowed from the market on December 2 at 18.95 percent, signalling the market's Selic at that level. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will hold its monthly policymakers meeting on Wednesday to discuss a new reference rate for the Selic. Traders and economists say the bank is most likely to leave the basic rate unchanged at 19 percent again. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Selic sets the yield on the government's domestic debt and is also used as a basis for consumer loan rates. It has come down from a peak of 45 percent reached after January's devaluation of the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the real\tab  .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((Sao Paulo newsroom, 55 11 248 5532)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvce083s6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760