\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  real firms on suspected c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 November 1999\par 13:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par SAO PAULO, Nov 23 (Reuters) - \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's real\tab   firmed to 1.932 per dollar in early trade Tuesday as traders suspected the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to support the real by selling the U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the market, traders said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The real opened at 1.933 against the dollar, firmer compared to Monday's 1.934 finish but quickly weakened to 1.935.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  Traders speculated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped into the market to prevent the real from weakening further. The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice last week to the defend the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Everybody was expecting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the dollar started to strengthen," said one trader. \par \par \uc2  In keeping with custom, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not able to confirm whether it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday until after the market closed. \par \par \uc2  On Monday, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president Arminio Fraga said the bank would reduce the number of its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market from the start of next year. \par \par \uc2  He said a recent wave of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been prompted by a large concentration of year-end foreign debt payments and nervous global market conditions, which put additional pressure on emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The real has lost 37 percent since mid-January when the government was forced to devalue the real amid capital flight. \par \par \uc2  ((Sao Paulo newsroom, 55 11 248 5423)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvbn09hfl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
