ign debt payments and nervous global market conditions, which put additional pressure on emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The real has lost 37 percent since mid-January, when the government was forced to devalue the real amid capital flight. \par \par \uc2  ((-Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5417)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvbn09bhu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
