\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  cenbank to reduce  \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions \highlight\uc2  2000. \b0\par\par\uc2 213 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 November 1999\par 19:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, Nov 22 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chairman Arminio Fraga said Monday the bank would reduce the number of its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market from the start of next year. \par \par \uc2  Fraga told reporters in Rio de Janeiro that a recent wave of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been prompted by a large concentration of year-end foreign debt payments and international market conditions, which put additional pressure on the real. \par \par \uc2  "Due to that, we had an option to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and we have been doing so," Fraga said. "(But) Our evaluation is that it is a seasonal problem and that at the beginning of next year the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will go back to normal." \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Brazil's real \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \tab   was little changed at 1.934 per dollar Monday from Friday's close of 1.933 in a timid market wary of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar sales.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Though the real only showing slight losses last week, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  twice, Wednesday and Friday, sending a message to the market that it was willing to defend the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The real has lost 37 percent of its value since huge capital flight forced Brazil to devalue in mid-January.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5532)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvbm09gs3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
