r measured by the IPCA, of less than 8% in 1999.\par   -By Ben Backwell, Dow Jones Newswires; (5521) 580 9394;\par     benjamin.backwell@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1156 1843 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010826dvbj01nrp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
