\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Seen  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2   Market \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 November 1999\par 20:13\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  RIO DE JANEIRO -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, selling dollars to support the real, said traders said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  phoned dealers asking for spreads on the real when the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened to BRR1.9390 per dollar, and then soon began to sell dollars in the market, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the real began to weaken on rumors that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary-policy committee was holding an extraordinary meeting to discuss hiking interest rates. \par \par \uc2  The real was trading stronger at BRR1.9290 per dollar shortly after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The real opened Wednesday at BRR1.9310 to the dollar. Trading has been volatile throughout the day in moderate volumes. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, selling dollars to support the real, said traders said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  phoned dealers asking for spreads on the real when the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened to BRR1.9390 per dollar, and then soon began to sell dollars in the market, traders said. \par \par \uc2  (The item timed at 1913 GMT incorrectly reported the level of the real.) \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman denied that any meeting of the Copom was taking place. \par \par \uc2  "We have no idea where this rumor is coming from," said the spokesman. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president Arminio Fraga confirmed that the bank had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, according to local news agency Estado. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par When asked about a possible Copom meeting, Fraga said "I am not even\par going to comment," according to Estado.\par By Ben Backwell and Adriana Arrai, Dow Jones Newswires;\par  (5521) 580 9394; benjamin.backwell@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010827dvbh005hg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
