\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  CenBank confirms  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  mkt. \b0\par\par\uc2 286 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 November 1999\par 21:10\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRASILIA, Nov 17 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Arminio Fraga confirmed Wednesday that the bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  "It is true," Fraga said during a press conference, when asked about suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday. Earlier in the day, traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , selling dollars for the local real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came with a much smaller fall in the real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  than the decline in the real which prompted the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , on November 17. \par \par \uc2  At the end of October, the bank announced it had agreed with the International Monetary Fund that it can use an additional amount of about $2 billion this year to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  As Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came with a much smaller fluctuation than the last time the bank stepped in, it could indicate the bank is getting more serious about keeping the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stable. \par \par \uc2  The real closed at 1.931 per dollar, after hitting a low point of 1.939. \par \par \uc2  One of the reasons for worries over the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent weeks has been concerns of a spike in inflation. Fraga said inflation this year would now stand "a little bit above 8 percent." \par \par \uc2  But, he said inflation had risen recently due to temporary factors, such as the end of an agreement holding car prices down and higher fuel prices. \par \par \uc2  "They are temporary events and I continue to see inflation within the trajectory of our targets," he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is targeting an inflation rate of 8 percent this year, with an accepted divergence of 2 percentage points. ((Raquel Stenzel, Brasilia Newsroom, 55-61-314-1193)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dvbh09rgq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
