\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  CenBank confirms  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  mkt. \b0\par\par\uc2 184 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 November 1999\par 20:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BRASILIA, Nov 10 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Wednesday, after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell sharply at the opening of trade. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market today," a spokeswoman from the bank said. Traders said the bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  early in the session Wednesday selling dollars, sparking a strengthening of the real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  finished the session at 1.929 per dollar Wednesday after opening much weaker at 1.947 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market October 27. \par \par \uc2  At the end of October, the bank announced it has agreed with the International Monetary Fund that it has an additional amount of about $2 billion that it can use to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market this year. The real has been on a generally strengthening trend since then. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell through the 2-per-1 dollar level in October, prompting 