\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  firms to 1.992/dlr amid  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  talk. \b0\par\par\uc2 225 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Oktober 1999\par 20:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, Oct 27 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  firmed to 1.992 per dollar, strengthening 0.6 percent from the day's weak point of 2.004, amid reports the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling greenbacks, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "There is no other explanation for a retreat of this size in a question of minutes except the participation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  selling dollars," one local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader said. Others also said they believed there was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  altered its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy after it failed to prop up the real with daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  amid huge capital outflows in December and January. The bank finally let the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  float against the dollar in mid-January. It has lost 39.3 percent of its value since then. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in August, but has more frequently used dollar-indexed domestic debt auctions to take pressure off of the real. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened in early trade after the privatisation auction of Tiete utility. \par \par \uc2  Although AES Corp.  won by offering a generous 938.1 million reais for the controlling stake, the market was disappointed because much of the purchase will be financed internally, traders said. \par \par \uc2  ((Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5408)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010909dvar017iq\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (brazil near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl